-- what an observation of window w sees: the basins as points, a path wherever they interconvert faster
-- than w. This is F_w(s, κ), and taut-respects says which properties can be stated of the chain under w.
fp-view : (C : Type 0) → FoldProblem C → Nat → Type 0
fp-view C F w = Taut (fp-basin C F) (ic-within (fp-basin C F) (fp-rate C F) w)
